<title>INDIA: Indian Dec 96 industrial output up 4.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Indian Dec 96 industrial output up 4.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's index of industrial production increased by 4.1 percent in December 1996 over the same month in 1995, the government said.  </p>
<p>    INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION     Dec 96    Nov 96    Dec 95</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	  +4.1	+4.3     +10.6</p>
<p>     -Mining			 -0.1	+3.4	+2.6</p>
<p>     -Manufacturing		+4.7	+4.1     +13.2</p>
<p>     -Electricity		  +3.7	+5.8	+3.5</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1980/81)  318.2     296.2     305.7</p>
<p>Note - Figures for December 1996 are preliminary. Figures for November 1996 have been revised.  </p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    CUMULATIVE			 Apr-Dec 96    Apr-Dec 95</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change		+8.3	    +11.4</p>
<p>     -Mining			     +1.8	     +8.2</p>
<p>     -Manufacturing		   +10.1	    +12.5</p>
<p>     -Electricity			+3.7	     +8.9</p>
<p>     Index (base 100=1980/81)     294.4	    271.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures for December 1996 are preliminary.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
